{"video":"cAR0yjHuczc","lines":[{"t":[0,3.1],"en":"While we are waiting for our special guest to arrive,"},{"t":[3.6,9.4],"en":"I wanted you all to take a look at a few of the many, many disabled icons"},{"t":[9.4,11.4],"en":"who have contributed so much to our society."},{"t":[11.8,12.3],"en":"Quick question."},{"t":[12.6,12.8],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[13,15.5],"en":"Why is Tom Hanks on the wall twice?"},{"t":[16.1,16.8],"en":"Good question."},{"t":[17.5,19.6],"en":"Forrest Gump, mentally challenged."},{"t":[20.3,21.9],"en":"Philadelphia, AIDS."},{"t":[22.2,23.8],"en":"I think that's from Big."},{"t":[24.7,26.6],"en":"I don't think so, no."},{"t":[27,29.1],"en":"Yeah, he's dancing on a piano with Robert Loggia."},{"t":[29.1,30.9],"en":"He grew into a man overnight."},{"t":[31.5,32.3],"en":"Rare disability."},{"t":[32.4,32.9],"en":"It still works."},{"t":[35.2,36.9],"en":"A crossword puzzle, Stan Lee?"},{"t":[37.2,39.2],"en":"Seriously, are you learning nothing here?"},{"t":[39.6,40.2],"en":"Mm-hmm."},{"t":[40.6,41.8],"en":"What do you mean, mm-hmm?"},{"t":[42.3,43.7],"en":"I mean I'm learning nothing."},{"t":[43.9,44.2],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[44.5,45.2],"en":"Michael Scott."},{"t":[45.2,46.1],"en":"I'm looking for Michael Scott."},{"t":[46.2,46.6],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[47.2,48],"en":"Right in here."},{"t":[48.4,48.7],"en":"Good."},{"t":[49,49.6],"en":"Come on in."},{"t":[49.7,49.9],"en":"Great."},{"t":[50.5,53.6],"en":"This, ladies and gentlemen, is our special guest."},{"t":[54.7,55.6],"en":"Sorry I'm late."},{"t":[55.8,57.5],"en":"Somebody parked in the handicapped parking space."},{"t":[58.3,60.7],"en":"Hey, everyone."},{"t":[61.1,62.3],"en":"I'm Billy Merchant."},{"t":[62.5,63.9],"en":"You may have seen me around here before."},{"t":[64.4,66.7],"en":"I'm the properties manager of this office park."},{"t":[67.1,68],"en":"You are so brave."},{"t":[68.7,69.7],"en":"You are so brave."},{"t":[70,70.4],"en":"Thank you."},{"t":[70.7,72.7],"en":"Actually, I've been meaning to come by here for a long time."},{"t":[72.7,74.1],"en":"But it's hard for you, right?"},{"t":[74.2,75.1],"en":"Because you're in a wheelchair."},{"t":[76.4,78.5],"en":"No, I just have a lot of properties to manage."},{"t":[78.5,79.3],"en":"Let me ask you something."},{"t":[79.9,83.3],"en":"How long does it take for you to do something simple every day?"},{"t":[83.4,85],"en":"Like brush your teeth in the morning?"},{"t":[85.3,86],"en":"I don't know."},{"t":[86,87.1],"en":"Like 30 seconds?"},{"t":[87.3,88],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[88.5,90.5],"en":"That's three times as long as it takes me."},{"t":[91.7,93.7],"en":"How did you get in your wheelchair?"},{"t":[94.2,94.7],"en":"This morning?"},{"t":[95.5,96.4],"en":"Just like every other morning."},{"t":[96.5,97.1],"en":"Just climbed on in."},{"t":[98.1,99.3],"en":"Hey, hey, hey, hey."},{"t":[99.4,100],"en":"Not funny."},{"t":[100,100.5],"en":"Not funny."},{"t":[100.8,101.7],"en":"Hey, hey, relax."},{"t":[101.9,103.2],"en":"Just joking around here."},{"t":[103.8,104.5],"en":"Well, that's good."},{"t":[105,106],"en":"He still has a sense of humor."},{"t":[106.4,109.3],"en":"Listen, I've actually used a chair since I was four years old."},{"t":[109.8,110.8],"en":"I don't really notice it anymore."},{"t":[111,111.4],"en":"Well, they do."},{"t":[111.5,112.4],"en":"They notice it, don't you?"},{"t":[113.1,113.8],"en":"You notice it."},{"t":[113.8,116.1],"en":"It's the first thing you saw when he rolled in here, isn't it?"},{"t":[117.3,119.7],"en":"I want to clamp Michael's face in a George Foreman grill."},{"t":[120.6,123],"en":"So, there are just a couple things I want to remind everybody of."},{"t":[123.2,123.5],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[123.6,124.5],"en":"First is parking."},{"t":[125.1,128.5],"en":"You can't block the freight entrance with your car, even if your blinkers are on."},{"t":[128.9,129.8],"en":"Does anybody have any questions?"},{"t":[131.3,131.7],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[133.8,134.1],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[135.9,136.3],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[138.1,139.4],"en":"Dwight, you have your hand up."},{"t":[143.1,143.7],"en":"Ignore him."},{"t":[144.5,144.9],"en":"You know what?"},{"t":[145.9,146.9],"en":"We're not that different."},{"t":[147.1,147.6],"en":"You and I."},{"t":[148,151.5],"en":"When I clamped my foot into a non-stick."},{"t":[151.5,152.1],"en":"You know what, Michael?"},{"t":[152.2,152.5],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[153.3,154.5],"en":"Let me stop you right there."},{"t":[154.5,154.9],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[155.1,155.7],"en":"And leave."}]}
